## Kernel contract

This repo participates in the alawein kernel (profile `${profile}`, kernel
version `${kernel_version}`). Managed files carry a `kernel:managed`
marker; edit content outside the marker block, not inside it. Conformance is
verified by `repo-drift`'s `kernel_conformance` detector against
`.kernel-manifest.json`. See
[`docs/governance/kernel-spec.md`](https://github.com/alawein/alawein/blob/main/docs/governance/kernel-spec.md)
in the hub for the canonical structural spec.
